*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Include          ZGTPPR2040F01
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form GET_PARAMETER_DESCRIPTION
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& -->  p1        text
*& <--  p2        text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM GET_PARAMETER_DESCRIPTION .

* SPG
  IF NOT P_SPGCD IS INITIAL.
    CLEAR ZPPT0107.
    SELECT SINGLE DESCR INTO P_DESCR
             FROM ZPPT0107
            WHERE SPGCD EQ P_SPGCD.
  ELSE.
    CLEAR P_DESCR.
  ENDIF.

ENDFORM.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form MODIFY_FIRST_SCREEN
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& -->  p1        text
*& <--  p2        text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM MODIFY_FIRST_SCREEN .

  LOOP AT SCREEN.
    IF SCREEN-GROUP1 = 'M1'.
      SCREEN-INPUT = 0.
      SCREEN-INTENSIFIED = 1.
      MODIFY SCREEN.
    ENDIF.
    IF SCREEN-GROUP1 = 'M2'.
      SCREEN-INPUT = 0.
      SCREEN-INTENSIFIED = 1.
      MODIFY SCREEN.
    ENDIF.
  ENDLOOP.

ENDFORM.
